    <question no="13" id="PRB-426E3813D97BDB8C-Q13" type="긍정형(옳은/적절한 것 고르기)" category="어법·규범·어휘형">
      <stem>마이켈리스－멘텐(Michaelis-Menten)식을 따르는 효소반응이 있다. 기질(S) 농도와 반응속도($- r_{S}$) 데이터를 이용한 라인위버－버크 플롯(Lineweaver-Burk plot)에서 직선의 세로축$\left( \frac{1}{- r_{S}} \right)$ 절편과 기울기를 각각 $a$와 $b$로 표기했을 때, 마이켈리스－멘텐 상수($K_{M}$)에 해당하는 것은?</stem>
      <formulas count="9">
        <formula area="질문">- r_{S}</formula>
        <formula area="질문">\left( \frac{1}{- r_{S}} \right)</formula>
        <formula area="질문">a</formula>
        <formula area="질문">b</formula>
        <formula area="질문">K_{M}</formula>
        <formula area="선택지①">a overb</formula>
        <formula area="선택지②">b overa</formula>
        <formula area="선택지③">a overb^2</formula>
        <formula area="선택지④">b overa^2</formula>
      </formulas>
      <choices count="4">
        <choice no="1" is_answer="false">$\frac{a}{b}$</choice>
        <choice no="2" is_answer="true">$\frac{b}{a}$</choice>
        <choice no="3" is_answer="false">$\frac{a}{b^2}$</choice>
        <choice no="4" is_answer="false">$\frac{b}{a^2}$</choice>
      </choices>
      <answer source="정답표" cross_check="">2</answer>
      <explanation_ref file="화학공학일반_해설.xml" question_no="13">정답 ② · 어법·규범·어휘형 (멘텐(Michaelis-Menten), 버크 플롯(Lineweaver-Burk plot))</explanation_ref>
    </question>
    <question no="14" id="PRB-426E3813D97BDB8C-Q14" type="수치/계산 도출형" category="수리·계산·자료해석형">
